{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年61歲的影帝張家輝入行多年拍過多套經典電影，先後憑《証人》及《激戰》兩度奪得金像獎最佳男主角，名聲之大連日本影迷都為之狂熱，曾有位極度熱血的日本影迷為了親眼一睹張家輝在港鐵站的巨型廣告，更特別搭凌晨機「快閃」即日來回香港。</p><p>近日社交平台流</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:21:56.783296+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:01:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.135677+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:18:35.135677+00:00","content_hash":"d10ddfa5c22f403059e2c6d97faa5af1e821e43e2e442dd6a0c4d5ddf2feffa8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}